  "created": "2026-11-10T02:42:34.573Z",
  "description": "A .NET tool for migrating a legacy multilingual website (PHP, ASP, any CMS) to a static site. Mirror HTML becomes frontmatter Markdown for Hugo, Eleventy or Astro; language versions are paired automatically (hreflang, slugs, shared media, dates) and what cannot be paired is listed for review; 301 redirect maps are written for nginx, Netlify and Cloudflare Pages; links, media and redirects are verified offline. Config-driven and re-runnable offline.",
